The neuron model in src/features/fly-connect4/sim/ is a TypeScript port of
github.com/philshiu/Drosophila_brain_model, also under the MIT License:
Copyright (c) 2023 Philip Shiu and Nico Spiller.

Data: the brain files in public/fly-brain/ are derived from the MaleCNS v1.0
connectome (Janelia FlyEM, MRC LMB Cambridge, Google Research et al.; Berg S.
et al., Cell 2026) and are distributed under CC-BY 4.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). If you reuse them, credit the
MaleCNS authors.
